From 95a6a000a61684db0c88effcb6bd1b6bea9b1569 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:05:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] lavender: contiguous IOSurface arena (sweetsurf_arena=MB,
 default 256 with gpu=1): GPU-shareable surfaces cut from 32 MB chunks set
 aside at boot, so the GPU reads them in place instead of eagl copying them;
 LVGPU log: the core's real clock and busy %

---
 iokit/Kernel/arm/RedwoodGPU.cpp   |   2 +-
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetSurface.cpp | 205 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetSurface.h   |   4 +-
 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp  |  27 ++++
 4 files changed, 236 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

